<title>SOUTH KOREA: Korea Tech, six other IPOs start trading.</title>
<headline>Korea Tech, six other IPOs start trading.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea Technology Banking Corp's shares started trading on Tuesday with its base price set at 20,000 won per share against their offer price of 9,000 won, the Korea Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Along with Korea Technology, six other offerings also started trading.</p>
</text>
